        "TileImage": "$($repository 9514999b-766c-4eef-8e42-9b16279bebdb).Image",
        "Description": "47, listen. Before you eliminate Don Yates and Tamara Vidal, you must eliminate two targets. Aron ford Jr. is a lawyer hired by Don Yates who will try to gain information about Diana and then leak it to the public. You must stop him at all cost. The second target is Mateo Roca. He is an ICA operative sent here to eliminate you. To avoid any kind of problems you should take care of those two guys. You know how to do that. Good luck.\r-Olivia",
